@host = https://localhost:7180

### Public configuration
GET {{host}}/api/config
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) Chrome/130.0 Safari/537.36

### robots.txt
GET {{host}}/robots.txt

### Scraper User-Agent → 403
GET {{host}}/api/config
User-Agent: python-requests/2.32.0

### Fake Googlebot → 403
GET {{host}}/api/config
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; Googlebot/2.1; +http://www.google.com/bot.html)

### Anti-crawler trap → 404 and your IP gets blocked (restart the app to unblock)
GET {{host}}/_internal/archive
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) Chrome/130.0 Safari/537.36
